Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.42,0:00:16.78,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Pa Pa, Pa Pa Pa Pa
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.78,0:00:19.64,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Pa Pa, Po Pe Pu Pi Pa
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.31,0:00:23.46,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Bustling from morning to night
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.46,0:00:26.91,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Laughing from a prank gone right
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.91,0:00:30.26,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Tapping out when duty calls
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.26,0:00:33.64,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Pa Pe Pu Pu, Pe Po Pa Po, Patalliro!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.64,0:00:36.98,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Transforms when he has a chance
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.98,0:00:40.27,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Takes off like a rocket blasting through the sky
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.27,0:00:43.77,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Slips up and blacks out
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.50,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Pa Pe Pi Pu, Pe Po Pa Po
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.67,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Patalliro!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.67,0:00:54.30,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,There are unimaginable things out there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:01:00.29,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,And that's what he loves the most!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.18,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,It all gets at sixes and sevens
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:11.07,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,550}That's the kind of big shot he is, Patalliro!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.05,0:01:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the charter plane of Malynera.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.66,0:01:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems so.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.77,0:01:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When the King of Malynera was young,\Nhe came to our country to study abroad.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.64,0:01:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to his son\Ncoming as a goodwill ambassador.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.89,0:02:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That seems a bit strange...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.39,0:02:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it corrected itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.92,0:02:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Your Highness Patalliro! \NYour Highness, stop...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.58,0:02:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a salesman, go away! \NI'm not buying anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.72,0:02:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a salesman.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.91,0:03:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Or if you're selling insurance.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.21,0:03:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What insurance man would come here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are loud. Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.97,0:03:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is who I am. {the mi6}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.31,0:03:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A pocketbook vendor? \NI already have a pocketbook.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.19,0:03:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you blind? \NThis badge should tell you everything! {( NOTE: More literally "Can't this badge enter your eyes?" )}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it doesn't seem talkative. {I don't know if I can get it in. Should I try?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.42,0:03:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.96,0:03:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Bancoran of MI6. \NEngland's Military Information Bureau, section 6.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything from your bureau.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.98,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.23,0:03:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was appointed to be His Highness,\NPatalliro's, bodyguard. Where is His Highness?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness seems to be out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool! In whose presence do you think you are? {Who do you think\Nis standing in your presence?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.99,0:04:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.44,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this: The prince of Malynera, \NHis Highness Patalliro VIII... is me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.67,0:04:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing like the picture.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was touched up a little bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was it touched up to look like this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.56,0:04:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Men don't worry about the small details!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.21,0:04:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Patalliro VIII. Age 10. Height 140cm. \NWeight 36kg. Bad personality. Hm, exactly.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.99,0:04:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! \NI don't need a bodyguard, so go home!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.68,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.21,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal family and Prime Minister\Nin Malynera are in conflict right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.51,0:04:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You risk being targeted by\Nthe Prime Minister. And besides that...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.74,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.35,0:04:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure you don't try something\Nstupid like you did on the charter flight!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.46,0:04:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my Minionion's fault.\NHe wouldn't let me fly the plane. {tamanegi - the name of his royal guard, tamanegi means onion}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada? Thanks for your trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.14,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.91,0:05:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada's been working as my servant for a long time. {imatu: using his name instead of pronouns to make it ambiguous for now}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.47,0:05:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.24,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Men don't worry about the small details.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you blushing for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.89,0:05:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.40,0:05:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada's reaction is normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.51,0:06:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rumored that when the Major is staring at them, \Nany beautiful boy will space out like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.73,0:06:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,His private name is "Pretty Boy Killer." {mata no na = another name}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Private name...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your privates have a name?! {mata = groin}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The man from the Information Bureau?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.32,0:06:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He insisted on staying in the room next door.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll cause trouble, won't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.11,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it'll probably work out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.78,0:06:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, have the\Narrangements for our plan been set up?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Swiping a painting from\Nthe London Art Museum is a big job.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.75,0:06:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada, are you certain about the rumor you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.39,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems my father was\Na romantic, but he messed up
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.21,0:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and hid the love letters from his time \Nas an exchange student here behind a painting.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.32,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So His Majesty the King wanted to lock away\Nhis memories of love in a quiet corner of London, didn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.72,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, he didn't have to hide it in a museum.\NIf the minister gets his hands on it,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.63,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll instantly become a huge scandal!\NPeople will lose confidence in my father
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,while the minister's image improves.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.55,0:07:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, before that happens, we have to get it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.86,0:07:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, my father is so troublesome...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.44,0:07:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the pocketbook vendor?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.63,0:07:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's a pocketbook vendor? I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.25,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already in.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you two discussing?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.57,0:07:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks a lot like you're plotting something...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.73,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we been caught? The truth is, we were\Nthinking of sneaking out and going to the playboy club.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be under my constant\Nsupervision tonight—I'll make sure of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well then, I'll go back to my room.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.89,0:08:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say "constant supervision," \Nwhat are you going to do? There's only one bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped. We'll sleep together.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you plan on raping me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.46,0:08:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather drown myself in the Thames River!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.18,0:08:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.52,0:08:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty Boy Killer...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.38,0:08:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say it out loud, it has a sexy ring to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.99,0:08:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.\NI'll make you my entertainer for tonight. {sounds like he implies "my sex slave"}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.42,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.15,0:08:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd do something like that if it weren't their duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sneak out, I'll notice right away!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.64,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How many boys have you made cry up to now?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.49,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cling to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.89,0:09:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pipe down and go to sleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Be quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.76,0:09:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.12,0:10:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's you, Bancoran...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not there...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.10,0:10:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't turn on the lights, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.41,0:10:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop having weird dreams!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.90,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.75,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't seen?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.47,0:11:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that Major?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.84,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let him sleep last night,\Nso he should be sound asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.89,0:11:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a rendezvous with Elizabeth\Nat 1:00 today. I have to leave by then.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.91,0:11:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate MI6.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.44,0:11:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently 10:00. We can't mess up\Nthe timing—it has to be 10:30 exactly.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.55,0:11:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the Major's eyes...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.69,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wasn't holding him down last night, \Nhe might've forced his way into {\i1}your{\i0}{\i0\fsp3} {\fsp0}bed! {/sneaked}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have minded that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.94,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Get into position already! Come on! Go! {/to your post}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.34,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they scheming?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.49,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this my father's painting? \NThe painting of King Higgins the Third of Malynera...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,10:29...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.74,0:13:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, don't panic! \NThe emergency exit is this way!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's this way!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.51,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, everyone! \NDon't panic, stay calm! Please don't panic!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.65,0:13:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the painting has been stolen!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Oh, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A suspicious guy fled from the front entrance!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.40,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You, get to the front entrance! After him!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.71,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it okay to just leave the frame here? \NShouldn't the police examine the fingerprints?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's true!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you seem to be busy, \NI'll take it to the police instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! I appreciate your help!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.28,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Patalliro, get down!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.71,0:14:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? \NEven the pocketbook vendor popped out...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.79,0:14:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, now's a good time to look for letters.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Patalliro, what are you doing?! \NYou're being shot at. Hurry up and leave!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.80,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is the rumored cockroach-style run!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.55,0:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty Boy Killer...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.59,0:16:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan was flawless. \NNo one should have noticed.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.67,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, those guards shot\Nat me from the start. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.31,0:16:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.49,0:16:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing. \NWelcome back, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.75,0:16:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it. Is my face that shocking?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.97,0:16:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.05,0:16:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not surprised?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be surprised?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.12,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,People seem to be surprised when they see my face.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I... I... {watashi? wow?}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.42,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to say \N"I only have my right eye!" {??????? idk what he's yapping about, maybe it's about patalliro's own eyes? maybe it's about him being drawn from the side so we can only see one of his eyes? maybe it's a pun on tamanegi somehow?}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad, it was the left.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, gotta find those letters! Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.55,0:17:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.68,0:17:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange... Jada!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no letters on the back! \NWhat's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.62,0:17:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.85,0:17:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world told you \Nthat rumor about the letters?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.49,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.78,0:17:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My father was having financial difficulties,\Nso I couldn't turn down this request...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.00,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To tempt Your Highness into stealing a painting...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.14,0:17:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Then that whole thing\Nabout the letters was a lie?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.52,0:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to do it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.95,0:17:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prime Minister...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.92,0:17:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.33,0:18:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know. I thought that Your Highness\Nwould only be driven into an embarrassing position...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought they'd try to kill you!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.36,0:18:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was made to steal the painting \Nand the guards would've shot me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.24,0:18:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I failed, an assassin \Ndisguised as a guard would've killed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.61,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards couldn't be charged \Nbecause they were only doing their duty.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.56,0:18:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Prime Minister could take advantage of the mess\Nthe ruling family would be in from losing their heir.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.93,0:18:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to kill an innocent boy like myself... \NHe might as well call himself the Pretty Boy Killer.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.48,0:18:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Your Highness. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.97,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.48,0:18:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't kill the guards shooting at Patalliro.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.49,0:19:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That is because I couldn't tell the difference\Nbetween the real guards and the fake guards.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.05,0:19:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet I fired grazed the back of the guards'\Nright hands, missing them by just one centimeter.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.05,0:19:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that would leave a burn on their hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.63,0:19:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's a burn mark!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jada, you couldn't possibly have...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.21,0:19:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do my job anywhere in the\Nworld if someone paid me enough for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.64,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! Now I understand why you\Nwere surprised to see me in the elevator.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.54,0:19:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to be dead, but I lived!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You were slow to notice.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.64,0:19:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.69,0:20:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you trick me, Jada! \NDeceiving a pure-hearted boy like me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.23,0:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Moron! Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten quiet, Patalliro.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.95,0:20:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you must feel sad \Nbeing betrayed by Jada, but don't lose spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.47,0:20:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me! \NI don't need your sympathy!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.99,0:20:25.11,Thought,,0,0,0,,Even if he's strong, he's still a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.67,0:20:27.04,Thought,,0,0,0,,He should want to cry...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.58,0:20:32.05,Thought,,0,0,0,,But as one would expect of the prince, he's tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.87,Thought,,0,0,0,,I can use this situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.61,0:20:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Patalliro! Patalliro!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to see me off?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.54,0:21:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb! You're taking Jada! \NWe haven't finished our investigation yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I got permission.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.79,0:21:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take him back and make him confess \Nwhat the Prime Minister asked him to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that killer really talk?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.86,0:21:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him I'd give him half of this\N10,000 pounds if he testified, so he happily agreed.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.34,0:21:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A-All that money...\NWhere did you steal it from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.38,0:21:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so judgmental. \NA certain person gave it to me as a present.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.87,0:21:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.75,0:21:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can these eyes lie?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're more untrustworthy than anyone else's!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.25,0:21:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought. The truth is, I got it \Nfrom the director of the art museum.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The director{ of the art museum}?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.89,0:21:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Among the guards that attacked me \Nwere the real museum guards.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.19,0:21:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I felt like it, I could have the director fired, \Nand at worst, it'd be an international problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.12,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So he gave me 10,000 pounds.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that blackmail?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it a present to Malynera.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.47,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's time.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kiss you farewell.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.53,0:22:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.11,0:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.94,0:22:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Patalliro! If you give 5,000 pounds to Jada, \Nwhat'll you do with the rest?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.43,0:22:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my allowance!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.76,0:22:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is a strong prince.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.74,0:22:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not strong. He's shameless.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.56,0:22:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That really was a worthwhile trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.57,0:23:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bancoran! By the way, Bancoran, \NI'm going to London again.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.67,0:23:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, Bancoran, I want you\Nto be my bodyguard. Bancoran...!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.24,0:23:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time on Patalliro: \N"The Flower Falls on a Misty Night."
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.47,0:23:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'll absolutely watch it!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.84,0:23:37.79,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Beauty is a sin {美しさは罪 by takeda eri; I wonder why the OP was in OCRed subs but not this; 美しさは罪　ほほえみさえ罪\N黒いバラの花　トゲがあるように\N優しく　つつみこんでゆく\N\N私の瞳の　奥を見てごらん\Nきっとあなたは　離れられなくなる\Nわたしを愛さない　ひとは居ない\N\N長い髪は罪　足音さえ罪\Nたとえ幾千の　時が流れても\N心は　きっと変わらない\N\Nあなたの為なら　この命さえも\Nたとえ捨てて　無くしてもかまわない\Nわたしを愛さない　ひとは居ない\N\N私の瞳の　奥を見てごらん\Nきっとあなたは　離れられなくなる\Nわたしを愛さない　ひとは居ない\N\Nわたしを愛さない　ひとは居ない}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.45,0:23:42.77,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Even a smile is a sin
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.77,0:23:48.46,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Like a black rose with thorns upon it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:56.50,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Softly wrapping around you
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.99,0:24:02.75,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Go on, look deep into my eyes
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.75,0:24:08.73,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,Soon, you won’t be able to leave me
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.19,0:24:20.19,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,There’s no one who could help but love me
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.61,0:24:34.66,Singing (Top),,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,777)}There’s no one who could help but love me
